# --- Rust Compiler Output ---
# Contains compiled binaries, artifacts, and dependency intermediate files
/target/

# --- Cargo Lockfile ---
# For binaries, keeping Cargo.lock is okay, but if you want to regenerate 
# or keep the root repository pristine, you can track it or ignore it.
# We keep it tracked for consistency in binary deployments, but target is always hidden.

# --- IDE Artifacts ---
# JetBrains / RustRover local configuration directories
.idea/
*.iml

# VS Code local workspace states
.vscode/

# --- System & Log Artifacts ---
# Local latency tracking and memory dump outputs
*.log
*.csv
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db